  "jobSupersession": {
    "note": "Which closing run job may quiesce the session. A `toolRunStart` retires the previous entry, so the OLD job's close runs after the NEW job has already installed its own port and reset the link's settled marker — and a closing job that reads the new run's markers as its own cancels the evaluation the new run is in the middle of, which paints the fresh preview `cancelled` and empties it. Only the job the link currently belongs to closes the session; a superseded one closes quietly, touching nothing. Ticket 26/09/09/PROCEDURAL-3D-END-TO-END.",
    "rows": [
      {
